{"step_index":981,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T19:04:30Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Detailed summary of the comprehensive futuristic cyber-industrial UI overhaul across all 5 platform tabs, command header, sidebar, and chart engines.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Comprehensive Futuristic Cyber-Industrial UI Overhaul\n\n## 1. Executive Summary of Enhancements\n\nThe entire application UI has been upgraded into a mission-control industrial quality intelligence platform with custom typography (`Orbitron`, `Rajdhani`, `JetBrains Mono`), dark glassmorphism, responsive telemetry cards, live animated status indicators, and zero visual clutter.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Key UI Components & Structural Upgrades\n\n### Global Canvas & Command Header\n- **Deep Space Industrial Grid**: Background with subtle cyan, violet, and emerald ambient radial glows and a 40px cyber grid.\n- **Mission-Control Command Banner**: Live telemetry HUD strip (`NEURAL ENGINE: GRAD-CAM ACTIVE`, `TOC CAPACITY ENGINE: MULTI-STAGE ARMORED`, `SIMULATION PROTOCOL: ARENA v16.2 COMPATIBLE`, `ACTIVE MODELS LOADED`).\n- **5 High-Impact KPI Stat Cards**:\n  - `Units Inspected`: Batch pipeline counter\n  - `Defects Identified`: Dynamic color accent (Crimson / Emerald) with defect rate\n  - `Review Queue`: Flagged count (Uncertain / Novel signatures)\n  - `Active Simulations`: Rockwell Arena dataset tracker\n  - `Inference Engine`: Real-time status indicator (`ONLINE` / `OFFLINE`)\n\n### Tab 1 — Quality Inspection\n- **Batch Dropzone & Action Row**: Clean 3:1 column layout with progress bar during inference.\n- **Redesigned Gallery Cards**:\n  - Top header with filename and glowing status badge (`PASS`, `DEFECT`, `UNCERTAIN`, `NOVEL`).\n  - Image viewport with dark glass borders.\n  - **Custom Confidence Progress Bar**: Real-time gradient bar with exact percentage.\n  - Localized bounding box pixel coordinates and classification probabilities.\n- **Batch Analytics & Telemetry**: Donut distribution chart, defect class signature counts, searchable telemetry log, and drift analysis.\n\n### Tab 2 — Production Flow Health\n- **Interactive Plant Process Topology**: Horizontal SCADA process flowchart (`Raw Stock` &rarr; Stations &rarr; `Shipped`) displaying live utilization percentages, glowing bottleneck cards, and animated pulse indicators.\n- **Theory of Constraints Constraint Box**: Detailed constraint station diagnostics, queue delay metrics, and Little's Law WIP buffers.\n- **Interactive Plotly Visualizations**: Utilization bars and queue waiting time charts with cyber neon palette.\n\n### Tab 3 — Root Cause Analysis\n- **Causal Evidence Matrix**: Evidence cards with severity color-coded left borders linking station overloads to physical defects (cracks, scratches, rust).\n- **Drift Analyzer & Trajectory Meter**: Real-time batch-to-batch drift slope (pp/unit) and trend charts.\n- **Out-of-Distribution (OOD) Review Table**: Isolated review table for novel signatures.\n\n### Tab 4 — Profitability & ROI Command Center\n- **5-Tile Financial Dashboard**:\n  - `Gross Revenue`: Emerald card\n  - `Scrap Loss`: Crimson card\n  - `Idle Cost`: Amber card\n  - `Opportunity Loss`: Violet card\n  - `Operating Margin`: Net profit and margin percentage\n- **Interactive What-If Simulation Cockpit**: Dual sliders for bottleneck idle reduction and scrap rate reduction with live projected profit lift.\n- **Actionable Prioritized Action Plan**: Ranked engineering fixes with direct dollar-value recovery estimates.\n- **Executive Report Exporter**: One-click markdown export.\n\n### Tab 5 — Digital Twin (ANN Surrogate)\n- **Metamodel Neural Architecture HUD**: Visual representation of the 2-layer ANN (`Input Layer` &rarr; `10 Hidden Tansig Neurons` &rarr; `Purelin Output` &rarr; `<0.05ms Latency`).\n- **Interactive Sliders & Prescriptive Optimizer**: Real-time vectorized neural predictions with automated bottleneck-free capacity solver.\n- **Cyber Gauges & Saturation Curves**: Gauge dials with 85% safety threshold and non-linear parameter sweep curves.\n- **Rockwell Arena vs ANN Validation Matrix**: $R^2$, $RMSE$, $MAE$ goodness-of-fit benchmarking with scatter plot.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Strict Rule Compliance\n- **Zero Emojis**: All indicators use CSS badges, animated pulse dots, or standard technical symbols (`&rarr;`, `[•]`, `[+]`, `[!]`).\n- **Zero \"NEURAX 3.0\" Titles**: Title is standardized to *\"Autonomous Quality & Process Intelligence Platform\"*.\n","Description":"Walkthrough artifact detailing the UI design system overhaul","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
